{"articleNo":"472731","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=472731&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] [공사 안내] 테크노관 승강기(15호기) 바닥 교체 공사 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2024.01.19","hit":"5518","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b>◇ 공 사 안 내 ◇</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">테크노관 승강기 카 내부 바닥 손상으로 아래와 같이&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">교체공사를 진행할 예정이며</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">작업중 <u><b>소음 발생</b></u> 등이 예상되오니</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;불편하시더라도 양해바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ▶&nbsp;대&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 상 :&nbsp;<font color=\"#0900ff\"><b>테크노관 15호기 승강기(도서관쪽 출입구)</b></font></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;공&nbsp; 사&nbsp; 일&nbsp;:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2024. 1. 20.(토)</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &n